    "body": "You can use the value attribute to pre-fill the field.\r\n\r\nAs for a placeholder, I think the one shown by browsers by default is more appropriate. The only case I can think of where something different might make sense is if you are accidentally confusing placeholders and labels; see the explanation of the difference between them at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#the-placeholder-attribute.",
